  "scope": "Original x8 storage for supplied Darwin AArch64 call prototypes, shared LLVM/HighC/LLVMC call transport, and independently certified logical-copy pointers in fixed and variadic stack slots. This is not automatic complete prototype recovery or complete arm64e qualification.",
  "initial_base_revision": "6b46d7db11742ce6cc1d8b4ce1f6d26aadfe932a",
