  "remaining": [
    "Automatic logical by-value reconstruction still requires independent effect/copy certificates. Arbitrary layouts, array fields, packed/overaligned records and further vector ABI shapes remain outside the admitted contracts.",
    "The earlier non-x8 typed-call matrix retains its recorded C O0 exception-class differences. Byte-identical exports preserve that earlier qualification and its limits; they do not remove those differences.",
    "The new controlled PAC model qualifies one aliased original-x8 storage shape across five key/modifier variants. Other stack/FP/variadic hidden-result shapes have ordinary native transport and object-compilation evidence, not equivalent active-PAC execution evidence.",
    "Whole-image authenticated storage creation, import installation, relocation emission and native signed Darwin exception unwinding remain separate gaps.",
    "Automatic complete prototype recovery, authenticated special-language calls, native Apple CPA2 and exact fault PC/ESR remain unqualified.",
    "Explicit variadic prototypes still require a nonempty fixed prefix."
  ]
